Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.72,0:00:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you've got me cornered, but\NI've already implemented my tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.02,0:00:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really hate to say it, but Okuyasu's\Nbrother just about took me out for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, I think it's high time\Nwe got the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about the bow and arrow he had?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.30,0:00:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard must have hit it somewhere\Nafter he dragged you up the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you wanna...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold off on looking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.52,0:00:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If their dad bought this\Nplace, he may still be around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, I'm too badly hurt\Nto be of much help to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just leave it be for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.42,0:00:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.33,0:00:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just do nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:00:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.01,0:01:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only reason I'm alive right now is\Nbecause you healed my wounds with your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If somebody else gets shot\Nwith that bow and arrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's face it, they're probably gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can stay here and rest up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.28,0:01:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.72,0:01:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find it by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.60,0:01:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And truth be told.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.04,0:01:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure their dad even\Nlives in this house anymore?.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, if he was living here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.50,0:01:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He would have come out by now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may not look it, but Koichi\Nhas a hell of a lot of guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.88,0:01:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least when things get\Ntough, or he's not in his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.12,0:01:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that won't mean a thing if\Nwe don't make it out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.90,0:01:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to leave as fast as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.70,0:01:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.61,0:01:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.88,0:01:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, you trying to stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.98,0:01:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna snap that bow and arrow in\Ntwo, then say goodbye to this hellhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:01:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together.
