Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.64,0:03:32.23,Title Part 4 Episode 2,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(614,626)\pos(130,880)\fs60}Episode 5: {\fs80} The Nijimura Brothers Part 3
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.85,0:03:34.52,Main,Koichi,0,0,0,,{\an8}They have an attic. Maybe the bow and arrow is up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bow and arrow's probably up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bow and arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.98,0:03:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's just hanging on the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.70,0:03:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something must be in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least it's\Nchained up, whatever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.88,0:04:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think it could be a dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's definitely not a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if it is, it sure isn't happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.90,0:04:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too scared to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By asking me, I voted to\Nleave this house of horrors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just turn back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Koichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the count of three, I want you to bust\Nthe door open with everything you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should scare it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll run over as fast as I can\Nand break that bow and arrow in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.46,0:04:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.26,0:04:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
