Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.30,0:05:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me! Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing is no stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.78,0:05:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a real hand attached\Nto a real funky-looking arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Char!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.25,0:05:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to sever it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Koichi, what the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.36,0:06:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe something like that\Nwas living right under our noses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.66,0:06:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was never supposed to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a long story, but he's our father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.34,0:06:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can believe it, and right\Nnow he needs these more than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he grabbing the bow and arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's imperative that I find\Nmore stand users for my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.98,0:06:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So no one is getting these.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come at me with all your might.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you must, I'll protect\Nhim until the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So did a disease do this\Nto your dad? A disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad is an excellent\Nhealth minus the warts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.38,0:06:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even has a hearty appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.44,0:06:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all he does is moan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.14,0:06:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's safe to say he has\Nno idea I'm his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:07:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you've been searching for a stand user
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.78,0:07:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the power to cure\Nyour father to cure him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you offering?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.64,0:07:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're not needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been searching for a stand\Nuser who can kill my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at this point, I\Ndoubt it'll ever happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.76,0:07:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what I do, Dad won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.60,0:07:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could bash his head in or chop\Nhis body into a million tiny pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.22,0:07:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even slicing him to\Nribbons won't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to end his suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a kid, I swore to do everything\Nin my power to make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.90,0:07:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I need the bow and arrow in order\Nto make good on my promise to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.64,0:07:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hand these over to you, dad\Nwill be a freak for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.41,0:07:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All because some bastard\Nnamed Dio decided to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.16,0:08:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,implant cells in his skull and\Nmake my dad a monster! Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.50,0:08:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.06,0:08:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy from Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro's story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indulge me by listening\Nto how things used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although what I'm about to tell you\Nis related to your life as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.64,0:08:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything began 11 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.48,0:08:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,1988 was the beginning of the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.62,0:08:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was 7 that year and my\Nbrother Okuyasu was just 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.18,0:08:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were living in Tokyo during this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.64,0:08:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the middle of the bubble\Neconomy and spirits were high.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the spirits of\Neveryone except my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.58,0:08:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom fell sick and died.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.36,0:08:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Dad's business went under, he\Nwas buried under a mountain of debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.48,0:08:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd often beat us for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the walking definition of a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:09:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when everything changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the blue, a seemingly endless\Nsupply of cash started rolling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And on top of that, there were\Njewels and precious metals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.76,0:09:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Dad didn't have a job to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.14,0:09:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After some research,\NI found out the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.78,0:09:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My father had made a dark deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.94,0:09:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sold his own soul to\Na man by the name of Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.26,0:09:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He became Dio's lackey for monetary gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.24,0:09:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on what I found out,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.08,0:09:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio's goal was to scour the globe\Nin search of potential stand users.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And somehow, he discovered my dad\Nhad the capacity to manifest a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.86,0:09:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, to this day, I have no idea\Nwhat the nature of his stand is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then things changed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been ten years, but I\Nremember it like yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was two in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.52,0:09:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd just come home from\Na long day at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.02,0:09:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did that bastard hit you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.94,0:10:01.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.09,0:10:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be the reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.10,0:10:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.48,0:10:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll call an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.46,0:10:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flesh blood is ravaging my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.84,0:10:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.26,0:10:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After a year, he didn't know who we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.76,0:10:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man had forgotten all\Nabout his own children
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and had become a muttering glob of flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.38,0:10:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio used to implant his own cells\Ninto the minds of those he distrusted
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he could manipulate his victims\Nin whatever way he saw fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as you can guess, he implanted\None of those things into Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For 10 years I threw myself into research.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i studied stands i learned about jotaro In
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my studies i learned of anyaba the hag and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,obtained possession of\Nthe bow and arrow But
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.32,0:11:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the process i slowly resigned myself to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.10,0:11:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the fact that dad would never recover from
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.28,0:11:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The curse that plagued him my father had
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,already become one with\Nthe immortal cells of dio
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he spends his days\Ndoing nothing but this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's infuriating to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every moment of every day\Nfor the past ten years,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.04,0:11:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's scratched around that\Nstupid box of rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I confiscate it, he wails\Nand groans for days on end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.14,0:11:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of dealing with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.04,0:11:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at his putrid face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes me disgusted with the\Nvery idea of life itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've told you over and\Nover, stop making a mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I've noticed, when I discipline\Nthe bastard, he seems to hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:12:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he keeps rummaging in his own filth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess the swine can't help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who needs to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still your father, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.34,0:12:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man is my father, but in blood only.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The detestable thing I see before\Nme isn't the father I used to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.90,0:12:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man sold his soul to Dio and\Nis living the life he created.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.88,0:12:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not totally without a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing my one and only father\Nlike this is unbearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want to do is end his life and\Nfinally free him from this suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by putting him out of his misery,\NI'll be able to live my life again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.90,0:12:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.50,0:12:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had just about enough of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.58,0:12:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the box right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've more than made your point!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I just can't let\Nyou have this bow and arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not now or ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.12,0:13:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That works for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just take that bow and arrow later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.96,0:13:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But right now, my sights\Nare set on that box!
