Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.52,0:13:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was clear from the way he\Nwas clutching those scraps
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of paper that there was\Nsomething important about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.70,0:13:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.14,0:13:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A family photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.96,0:13:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knew what he was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.66,0:13:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hasn't been mindlessly rummaging\Nthrough that box for ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.98,0:13:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's had a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was looking for the photo of\Nhis sons when they were young.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.12,0:14:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true that he's not completely\Naware of his surroundings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.14,0:14:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But deep down, his\Nmemories are still intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Memories of better days.
