Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.93,0:14:30.97,Eyecatch - Left,signbot,0,0,0,,{\pos(82,794)}Nijimura Okuyasu
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give up on looking for a stand that kills,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because if you focus on\Nusing one that heals instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'm willing to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first you'll have to hand over that\Nbow and arrow, because they're history.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.54,0:15:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not planning to run, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.06,0:15:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bro, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.54,0:15:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's end this already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.12,0:15:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in fighting him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.84,0:15:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you stuck around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a chance that could\Nget better, couldn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.30,0:15:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if he doesn't\Nlook the way he used to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.60,0:15:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stuff doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The important thing is, he'd\Nhave his memories and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nokuyasu, the hell do\Nyou think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.02,0:15:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.26,0:15:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it, Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.02,0:15:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see it's far too late for me\Nto just turn my back on the mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.00,0:15:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already slaughtered\Ncountless people in this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.28,0:15:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,town with the very bow\Nand arrow you're gripping!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.30,0:16:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, as far as I'm concerned,\Nyou're no longer my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.18,0:16:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As such, I have no qualms about\Nkilling you where you stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bro...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.90,0:16:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone else living here\Nbesides you two and your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.80,0:16:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Others?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.82,0:16:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's just the three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.97,0:16:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's coming from the outlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.92,0:16:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, pull your head\Nout of your ass, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.22,0:16:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! It broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be relieving you of this\Nbow and arrow, Keicho Nijimura!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do still remember me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.54,0:16:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you awakened my stand when\Nyou shot me with this arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:16:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do, and you are an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.30,0:17:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't handle the bow and arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.28,0:17:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keicho Nijimura!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stands are a manifestation of the soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've matured since you told me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.36,0:17:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But let me guess, you weren't\Nexpecting my stand, Chili Pepper,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to evolve to this degree!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,War's company, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.76,0:17:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more words!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that electricity?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.40,0:17:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu's brother is turning into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so is the bow and arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.58,0:17:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.96,0:17:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll get sucked into!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.82,0:17:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that work!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.26,0:17:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's stealing the bow and arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.42,0:17:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, I knew you'd find\Na way to screw me over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.82,0:17:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since we were kids,\Nyou've always held me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.98,0:17:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt in my mind that a stand\Nuser was watching us from that window.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you recognize that\Nstand back there, Okuyasu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.96,0:18:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bro was the one who found the STAND users,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.14,0:18:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and when he did, he didn't\Ntell me a lot about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.40,0:18:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, look! It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.32,0:18:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.26,0:18:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bro, I knew it was only a matter\Nof time before this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.06,0:18:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew all the bad things he did in\Nhis life would catch up to him one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.56,0:18:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, in the end, my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.20,0:18:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother used his dying moments\Nto save my life, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.14,0:19:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, you saw it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.36,0:19:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I couldn't have said it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.36,0:19:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever is false, your\Nbrother saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would this happen to be Jotaro Kujo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.46,0:19:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't recognize your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this and what do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The who doesn't matter, Jotaro Kujo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as for what I want, I'm kindly\Nasking you to get the hell out of Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let me see if I've got this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.26,0:19:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A complete stranger calls and\Nwants me to just up and leave town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.66,0:19:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you do if the\Nsituation was reversed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.62,0:19:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter since I\Nhave the bow and arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.36,0:19:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.28,0:20:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took it from Keicho\NNijimura after I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.44,0:20:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I don't mind getting\Nrid of you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard all about you, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.26,0:20:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that you have the ability to\Nstop time for one or two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.12,0:20:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since you're such a tough guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.16,0:20:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd take a shot at\Nconvincing you over the phone first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.34,0:20:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a stand user too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.36,0:20:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want with the bow and arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to cause you any trouble,\Nif that's what you're implying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.92,0:20:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as long as Josuke Higashikata\Nminds his own business,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.03,0:20:29.62,Episode 5 Typesetting 1,sign,0,0,0,,{\fry-0.04\frx7.76\fax-0.6\frz358.1)\move(806,716,712.98,716.02,26,5573)}Unavailable Number
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.03,0:20:29.62,Episode 5 Typesetting 1,sign,0,0,0,,{\fry0.05\frx7.11\frz-2.19\fax-0.4\move(1363,734,1270.39,734.03,26,5573)}Public Phone
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.03,0:20:29.62,Episode 5 Typesetting 1,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz357.8\move(1038,732,948,732)}Unavailable Number  Public Phone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.52,0:20:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lay a finger on him either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't had this stand\Nability for too long,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So my only priority right now is\Nto have a little fun. I've had
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough of dealing with mundane things\Nlike entrance exams and resumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.00,0:20:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're a student, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.12,0:20:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What difference does that make? Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.66,0:20:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you wear out your welcome,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.20,0:20:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you and Josuke\Nin ways that'll haunt you
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.72,0:20:51.77,Main,Jotaro,0,0,0,,{\an8}How many other Stand users are in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.78,0:20:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many other stand users\Nare there in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keicho Nijimura was buried in Kunimi\NPass Cemetery, west of Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.86,0:21:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the bow and\Narrow remains missing.
