Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.12,0:21:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For Okuyasu Nijimura, it was time to step\Nup and look after his father for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.13,0:21:22.17,Episode 5 Typesetting 2,sign,0,0,0,,{=0}{\fscy99.99\fscx99.99\pos(973.99,259.8)}Nijimura Family
