Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.66,0:21:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, can you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.68,0:21:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.82,0:21:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to go to school, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.03,0:21:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starting today, the two of us are\Ngoing to be going to the same school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.62,0:21:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, that doesn't mean\Nyou have to come and get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.32,0:21:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I never realized your house\Nand my house were so close together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.10,0:21:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.01,0:22:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But like I said, you don't\Nneed to walk me to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.94,0:22:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.85,0:22:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want us to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.18,0:22:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.09,0:22:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you one of Josuke's friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.68,0:22:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.59,0:22:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Okuyasu Nijimura!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.08,0:22:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on in and have some coffee\Nwhile he finishes getting ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.38,0:22:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.54,0:22:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.62,0:22:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you noticed that\Nyour mom's kinda hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.84,0:22:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right behind ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.06,0:22:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A comedian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.10,0:22:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.01,0:22:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.88,0:22:52.26,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.26,0:22:54.51,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.51,0:22:57.31,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.31,0:22:58.98,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.98,0:23:01.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.35,0:23:03.73,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.73,0:23:06.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.53,0:23:08.24,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.24,0:23:10.49,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.49,0:23:12.82,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.82,0:23:14.45,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.45,0:23:17.08,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.08,0:23:21.58,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.58,0:23:25.13,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.92,0:23:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I want you. I don't\Nknow if I need you, but ooh,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.13,0:23:30.59,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.59,0:23:33.97,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.62,0:23:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to find you.
